                <mxCell id="25" value="So when Delievery man see where to deliever the order he will fetch UserMap.address(1)&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;first user will see, products which is ArrayList I think arrayList would be better for like searching and get as it will take o(n) time, but gettng product o(1) I guess(&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);&quot;&gt;this products will map with dealerId through dealerMap)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);&quot;&gt;-then userDo addtoCart of product x, set quantity how many it is and then cart will show totalPrice user then order it so delieveryStatus changes to ORDERED.(so cart is something like FIFO like ordered i want then cart details will sent it to dealer correct?)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=ext;double=1;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1">
